.TH ARGUS 1 "2026-11-25" "argus 1.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
argus \- SAST and SCA security scanner
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B argus
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.RI [ target ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B argus
scans source code and dependency manifests.  It combines a built-in
intra-file dataflow engine for Java, Semgrep rule packs for other
languages, OSV-based dependency checks, secret detection and
infrastructure-as-code heuristics.
.PP
Reports are written as JSON, SARIF, Markdown or plain text.  Dependency
inventories can be exported as CycloneDX or SPDX SBOM, and SCA findings as
OpenVEX.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B scan
Run SAST and SCA together (the default entry point for a repository).
.TP
.B sast
Run static analysis only.
.TP
.B sca
Run dependency analysis only.
.TP
.B sbom
Write a CycloneDX or SPDX SBOM, or verify an existing signed SBOM.
.TP
.B vex
Export SCA findings from a JSON report as OpenVEX.
.TP
.B diff
Compare two JSON reports (new, fixed and unchanged findings).
.TP
.B bench owasp
Score an engine against the OWASP Benchmark.
.TP
.B bench sca
Score the SCA engine against the bundled fixtures.
.TP
.B db update
Download OSV archives for offline dependency scanning.
.TP
.B db status
Show the local OSV, SAST and threat-intelligence caches.
.TP
.B rules list
List the bundled Semgrep rules.
.TP
.B cwe
Browse the built-in CWE reference.
.TP
.B version
Print the argus, Python and Semgrep versions.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " " \fIjson\fR|\fIsarif\fR|\fItext\fR|\fImd\fR
Select the report format (default: json).
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " " \fIFILE\fR
Write the report to a file instead of standard output.
.TP
.BR \-\-summary " " \fIFILE\fR
Also write a human-readable Markdown summary.
.TP
.BR \-\-fail\-on " " \fIlevel\fR
Exit with status 1 when a finding at or above this severity exists
(default: high; use \fBnone\fR to disable).
.TP
.BR \-\-min\-severity " " \fIlevel\fR
Drop findings below this severity.
.TP
.BR \-\-config " " \fIFILE\fR
Load project configuration from an explicit argus.toml or argus.json.
.TP
.BR \-\-baseline " " \fIFILE\fR
Mark findings present in the baseline as existing.
.TP
.BR \-\-baseline\-out " " \fIFILE\fR
Write the current findings as a new baseline.
.TP
.BR \-\-fail\-on\-new
Fail only on findings that are missing from the baseline.
.TP
.BR \-\-ignore " " \fIFILE\fR
Load a suppression file (JSON, TOML or .argusignore); may be repeated.
.TP
.BR \-\-include\-suppressed
Show suppressed findings in human-readable and SARIF reports.
.TP
.BR \-\-exclude " " \fIPATTERN\fR
Skip paths matching a glob or directory name; may be repeated.
.TP
.BR \-\-jobs " " \fIN\fR
Use N worker processes (default: 1).
.TP
.BR \-\-offline
Use the local OSV database instead of the network API.
.TP
.BR \-\-db\-dir " " \fIDIR\fR
Use an explicit directory for the offline OSV archives.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-sast ", " \-\-no\-sca
Disable one half of a combined scan.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-secrets ", " \-\-no\-iac
Disable secret detection or infrastructure-as-code checks.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-sast\-cache
Disable the content-addressed Java analysis cache.
.TP
.BR \-\-threat\-intel
Enrich SCA findings with EPSS and CISA KEV data.
.TP
.BR \-\-no\-threat\-cache
Do not reuse the downloaded EPSS/KEV data.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
No findings at or above the configured threshold, or the quality gate passed.
.TP
.B 1
Findings at or above the threshold, or a quality gate violation.
.TP
.B 2
A scan error occurred (missing target, unreachable data source, missing
scanning backend).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/argus-scanner/runtime
Private Python environment with argus, its dependencies and Semgrep,
created and updated by
.BR argus-setup-runtime (1).
.TP
.I ~/.cache/argus
Default cache directory for the OSV database, SAST cache and EPSS/KEV
data.  Override it with \fBXDG_CACHE_HOME\fR or the corresponding options.
.TP
.I argus.toml , .argus.toml , argus.json , .argus.json
Project configuration files, discovered upwards from the scan target.
.SH EXAMPLES
Scan a repository and write JSON plus a Markdown summary:
.PP
.nf
argus scan ./src -f json -o report.json --summary report.md
.fi
.PP
Run only the static analysis and emit SARIF:
.PP
.nf
argus sast ./src -f sarif --fail-on high -o argus.sarif
.fi
.PP
Work without network access:
.PP
.nf
argus db update
argus sca . --offline
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR argus-gui (1),
.BR argus-setup-runtime (1),
.I /usr/share/doc/argus-scanner/README.Debian
.SH AUTHOR
argus contributors.
